---
---

<section class="phil">
  <div class="wrap phil-in">
    <div class="phil-copy reveal">
      <h2 class="phil-h2">
        We craft <em>experiences.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="phil-lead">
        Besides planning events, we create experiences worry-free.
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        "The most beautiful moments are those where neither the couple nor
        their guests ever once thought about logistics."
      </blockquote>
      <p class="phil-body">
        Apex sits at the intersection of artistry and precision. We bring an
        obsessive attention to detail, a quiet command of every room, and the
        rare ability to make the extraordinary feel effortless.
      </p>
      <a href="#process" class="btn btn-line">Our Approach</a>
    </div>
    <div class="phil-media reveal">
      <img
        src="/images/philosophy-staircase.webp"
        alt="Floral chuppah ceremony under a clear-top tent surrounded by cherry blossoms"
        width="700"
        height="880"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .phil { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .phil-in { display: grid; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); }

  .phil-h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
  }

  .phil-h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--brass-deep); }

  .phil-lead {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--stone);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .phil-body { margin-top: 1.8rem; color: var(--stone); max-width: 46ch; }
  .phil-in .btn { margin-top: 2.2rem; }

  .phil-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(280px, 45vw, 560px);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .phil-in { grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; align-items: center; }
  }
</style>
